* {{homophones|en|father}} (''in [[non-rhotic]] accents'')

===Adjective===
{{head|en|comparative adjective}}

# {{en-comparative of|far}}. Of or pertaining to being [[distant]], or of [[greater]] [[distance]] in degree or of extension in time.
#* '''1813''': ''Pride & Prejudice''
#*: The necessity must be obeyed, and farther apology would be absurd.

